{"title":"1993 USAMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55b3ffdd33c14d94e964424e4a67cde5a8bbc486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f : [0, 1] \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> which satisfy\n</p>\n<table><tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</td><td>(i)</td><td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0cd5dce73495458301961216e7272ef4ee67a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)\\ge0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab178d831a786b92cb4c9ddc2d33578223036f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0, 1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" />,</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</td><td>(ii)</td><td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6dd0ff40babd7fbd0c3e3d3b019627c27949616.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />,</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</td><td>(iii)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</td><td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b10eb6e96f1f642eb0f35e03ea62de2d074d89b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) + f(y) \\le f(x + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" /> whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> are all in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab178d831a786b92cb4c9ddc2d33578223036f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0, 1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" />.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Find, with proof, the smallest constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> such that\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/e/b1e93ec7efefb0af408a87d3d13e41a9e5bd902e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) \\le cx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<p>for every function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> satisfying (i)-(iii) and every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab178d831a786b92cb4c9ddc2d33578223036f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0, 1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>My claim: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986c121b96b1bc35a093a1acb25d9c62954d9b91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\ge2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Lemma 1</b>) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84a4ad57db75f091950886c522abddffde4b221b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n\\right)\\le\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"163\" height=\"46\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81fed5f0c8022894f4edf5ed74f9b3c01010fa1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\in \\mathbb{Z}, n\\ge0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/02349576cee613512cdf301a365f06c0760acab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc73712d7f1001a98e82f12a2706d1004bae0610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> (ii)\n</p><p>Assume that it is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bdca93962a2beaffc172ca394e04fe05bd74ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e924c441b74d9abfe5055c8d1c531d998ee59d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}\\right)+f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}\\right)\\le f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n-1}\\right)\\le \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"418\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/8/90805c2b8a9a11b36c8d11905968f35f708752d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}\\right)\\le \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"160\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>By principle of induction, <b>lemma 1 is proven</b>.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Lemma 2</b>) For any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e540a4f1b818b0392f74aa94088e592d702940d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n+1}&lt;x\\le\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n\\le1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"204\" height=\"46\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f56ae7bb91350d810fe4d7a811fa79fb57059a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda233fd7b455b62e1142a066c722ba930dae8ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)\\le\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"107\" height=\"44\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/26480e0c2fe369f0d5e999759bb3bb501732a208.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n-x\\right)\\le f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}\\right)\\le \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"362\" height=\"44\" /> (lemma 1 and (iii) )\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda233fd7b455b62e1142a066c722ba930dae8ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)\\le\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"107\" height=\"44\" /> (because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ff4b5e9a4f92f2d249cae22745cb7e5a64cb3a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n-x\\right)\\ge0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"156\" height=\"46\" /> (i) )\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/7501cc16b49cdd0d2ba5fa0ef93ed6303ab910c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall 0\\le x\\le 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4bedbc847605953911d1b2c182a30158408ab7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n-1}\\ge2x\\ge \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n\\ge f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"243\" height=\"48\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f72da4187cb0ff8d0471bef17474df62fe69c94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> works.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>Let's look at a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8bd330a0f8ba96d70707b5287baf062998d3d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{ll}0&amp;0\\le x\\le \\frac{1}{2};\\\\1&amp;\\frac{1}{2}&lt;x\\le1;\\\\\\end{array}\\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"208\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>It clearly have property (i) and (ii). For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb61859f9e9eb6abaf076d5c9d0e04f611c0905f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le x\\le\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"37\" /> and WLOG let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/3/28309f71c1128877b8dc886e384472f718bbe70a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\le y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6cc364c4ef9dec54706fd030656bdf31df64154.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f(y)=0+f(y)\\le f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"243\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c13d705e6c72b40990ed49b03750ed51ba298db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}&lt; x\\le 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"80\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc4a1c90dfeadcffcf48de00c72ed57f3bb105d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, property (iii) holds too. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is one of the legit function.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da6555dae995e7b94ab36cc6496c394cd7ba9872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\frac{1}{2}^+} cx \\ge \\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\frac{1}{2}^+} g(x)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"194\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83d7142639889ce9b146e9b14630fc8665690aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}c&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f641345aff611b747b752c7d7fb72f6e8d601e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> but approach to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is extremely close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> from the right side.\n</p>\n<p align=\"right\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bc988cfcc8e4785fd9c082dee348ca677398065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{Q.E.D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO\" title=\"1993 USAMO\">1993 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1993 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?p=356413#p356413\">Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017184158\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 278/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1267/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9188/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.315      1 -total\n 60.89%    8.716      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 35.60%    5.096      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8661:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017184158 and revision id 196898. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}